            [routerLink]=&quot;[&apos;/faq&apos;]&quot;&gt;"/>FAQ<x id="CLOSE_LINK" ctype="x-a" equiv-text="&lt;/a&gt;"/>.<x id="LINE_BREAK" ctype="lb" equiv-text="&lt;br&gt;"/><x id="LINE_BREAK" ctype="lb" equiv-text="&lt;br&gt;"/>We will get back to you as soon as possible.</target>
